    "q-105146": {
      "dom_id": "step-q105146",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "If $A=\\{1,8,\\{8,9\\},5,4,\\{2,7\\}\\}$, then $|P(A)|=$",
      "worked_solution": "For any set $A,$ we have $|P(A)|={2}^{|A|}.$ \n\nIn this case, $|A|=6,$ so we have\n\n$$\n|P(A)|={2}^{|A|}={2}^{6}=64.\n$$\n\nRemember that $\\{8,9\\}$ is a single element in the set $A,$ and the same is true for $\\{2,7\\}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
